                            "feminine",
                            "short-form"
                        ],
                        "form": "полуразва́лена"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "d3fb5ae4-f86b-4072-af9e-93942b05e19c",
                        "entry_id": "92871694-959a-36cd-95f3-551d478e2ea4",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "short-form"
                        ],
                        "form": "полуразва́лены"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dc8cc06d-d141-3801-90e3-4e4960af36c4",
                        "entry_id": "92871694-959a-36cd-95f3-551d478e2ea4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "частично (в значительной мере) развалившийся, разломанный"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "932f248c-f75a-4ebb-9429-d6b436c68df0",
                                "sense_id": "dc8cc06d-d141-3801-90e3-4e4960af36c4",
                                "text": "Нет, не нужно преувеличивать, и этот ветреный палящий простор тоже прекрасен, и в этих обломках старых, полуразваленных гор есть свое особенное, грустное очарование."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f73c94f4-2764-4345-9955-b5059e1d68e1",
                                "sense_id": "dc8cc06d-d141-3801-90e3-4e4960af36c4",
                                "text": "Почти весь широкий двор был заставлен поленницами дров. Одна из них была полуразвалена, дрова свалились и рассыпались по земле."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "46bc3877-d682-43d8-a62c-2b5106a1a107",
                        "source_entry_id": "92871694-959a-36cd-95f3-551d478e2ea4",
                        "source_sense_id": "dc8cc06d-d141-3801-90e3-4e4960af36c4",
                        "target_lang_word": "tumbledown",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tumbledown",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4b6b6820-e9ab-384f-8a15-34c52191ee75",
                                        "entry_id": "511ba35a-5f49-3d10-a49b-fd9fcc17d973",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In disrepair; poorly maintained."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3cec011d-66d9-4fc8-933e-31afd35204e6",
                                                "sense_id": "4b6b6820-e9ab-384f-8a15-34c52191ee75",
                                                "text": "They lived in a tumbledown shack on the edge of the woods."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20c890ae-9a92-4f47-a16d-1a960480441f",
                                                "sense_id": "4b6b6820-e9ab-384f-8a15-34c52191ee75",
                                                "text": "The cab pulled up in front of a tumbledown cheap ‘villa’ in an unfinished cheap neighbourhood, — the whole place a living monument of the defeat of the speculative builder."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6aaacd6-0291-42b6-bdba-07a120ced4db",
                                                "sense_id": "4b6b6820-e9ab-384f-8a15-34c52191ee75",
                                                "text": "Some distance north of both stations was a rather small and tumbledown shed for Great Central engines, and there was generally one or more goods tank engines outside it, painted black and lined out in red."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f0f6d83c-d62e-4fc7-8ba2-c79d14ca75d1",
                        "source_entry_id": "92871694-959a-36cd-95f3-551d478e2ea4",
                        "source_sense_id": "dc8cc06d-d141-3801-90e3-4e4960af36c4",
                        "target_lang_word": "dilapidated",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dilapidated",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f112e05e-fdec-37c1-a8c0-24b7fec054ac",
                                        "entry_id": "96c4280a-26f4-3238-a332-4bc434b6823f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "simple past and past participle of dilapidate"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "participle",
                                            "past"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "dilapidated",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c8078362-defe-3148-b987-6b304f53e998",
                                        "entry_id": "e804b558-cd3a-331b-90e8-4a46a5adb097",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having fallen into a state of disrepair or deterioration, especially through neglect."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9f45788-011e-4f4f-b9ca-936a2f4542ec",
                                                "sense_id": "c8078362-defe-3148-b987-6b304f53e998",
                                                "text": "Their stately offices—their pleasant gardens—the magnificent cloisters constructed for their recreation, were all dilapidated and ruinous; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "342e6cb9-ef4b-4cd7-9e95-7b5a04fe5dd9",
                                                "sense_id": "c8078362-defe-3148-b987-6b304f53e998",
                                                "text": "It was a strange scene, the contrasts which met in that large but dilapidated chamber. It had been the banqueting-hall in the ancient palace of the La Franchi, but the revelry and the splendour had long since passed away."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "926f1379-b71a-41e5-adbf-4c684d202541",
                                                "sense_id": "c8078362-defe-3148-b987-6b304f53e998",
                                                "text": "The Glenbrook Community Center is in disrepair and has been closed for a number of years, which means it is the exact kind of dilapidated and blighted building CAVE People will do everything to protect."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5e3a76d2-1d9d-49d6-9541-a8f056dec32b",
                        "source_entry_id": "92871694-959a-36cd-95f3-551d478e2ea4",
